## ⚡ Get Running in 5 Minutes

### What You Need First

- **Node.js 18 or higher** (for the frontend)
- **Python 3.11 or higher** (for the backend)
- **Git** (version control)

### Set Everything Up

#### If you want the whole thing (Frontend + Backend):
```bash
# Get Python stuff ready
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Get JavaScript stuff ready
npm install

# Make sure everything installed right
python -m pytest tests/ --collect-only  # Check Python side
npm run lint                            # Check TypeScript side
```

#### If you just want the frontend:
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

#### If you just want the backend (Python):
```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
python -m pytest tests/ -v
```

### Fire It Up

```bash
# Desktop app (Electron) - the full experience
npm run dev:electron

# Web version (in your browser)
npm run dev

# Command line mode
jpe-sims4 --help
jpe-studio  # Opens desktop app

# Build a test project
jpe-sims4 build ./path/to/project --build-id test_001
```

