## Real Talk

This project is comprehensive, no cap. You got frontend, backend, mobile, desktop - it's a whole ecosystem. The docs are here to help you navigate it. If something's confusing, check here first. If it's still confusing, your future self (or a teammate) will appreciate you updating these docs.

Keep the code clean, keep the tests passing, keep the vibes good.

Now go build something amazing. 🚀
